{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_03_end","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":7,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_03_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-3","storyName":"戏剧性","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"格蕾塔回应五年前的事故，并软硬兼施说服剧组实行拍摄天灾的计划；莫伊拉既替迈克尔洗清嫌疑，也向蒂比和服装师玛丽昂说出了迈克尔想要偷偷逃离地块一事。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_03_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_03","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":5,"next":7,"characters":["摄影助理","倒霉的场工","格蕾塔","阿布纳","卢西恩","蒂比","莫伊拉","迈克尔","玛丽昂"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_bg_62_g3_filmset.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_imprisonment_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_bat_imprisonment_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"格蕾塔女士，我们要遭遇天灾的消息到底是不是真的？","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"蓝卡坞的城际网络覆盖范围极大，即使地块开出主城区也能接收到天灾预警！为什么我们的终端没收到提醒？","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#4$1","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"所以最近的通讯信号时好时坏，难道不是因为我的运气，而是——","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"通讯设备被人蓄意破坏！","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"好了！无凭无据的怀疑是没有任何意义的。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"无凭无据？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":21},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","id":22},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我偶然在办公室里找到一些纸条，拼接之后能看出一份是特里蒙大学出具的天灾预测报告，另一份则是分镜表。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"格蕾塔·斯通女士，上面可有你的亲笔签字，你到底想做什么？","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#1$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"小子，让我看看。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":29},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我是摄影师，我怎么不知道新增了这几场戏？","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"为什么要在地块边缘布置摄影机？那里没有任何布景……等等，我明白了。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#8$1","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"格蕾塔！你*蓝卡坞片场术语*故意的？你瞒着我们这么大的事儿，你想干什么？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"……","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#6$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"阿布纳，冷静一点……格蕾塔女士可能只是没来得及把最新的排期告诉你，谢莉小姐刚刚过世，很多事情来不及交接……","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ee/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#8$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"你还替这个疯女人说话？她想让移动地块无限接近外层风暴拍摄实景天灾！我们所有人的命都有可能搭进去！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":43},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":44},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_smashtable","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"横眉怒目的摄影师将拍摄设备重重扔在地上。","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#8$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我受够了！我现在就要离开这个鬼地方！","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你还是这么冲动，阿布纳。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#8$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"冲动？疯了的是你！","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#4$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"为了弥补五年前那部电影票房的惨淡，你搭进去多少自己的资产？后来你的投资屡屡不顺，想用这部电影翻身……","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"告诉我，要是这部电影也变成赔钱货，道尔顿和谢莉的意外是不是会变成你利用的对象？就跟当时那个坠亡的小演员一样！","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"别这么着急，阿布纳。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你记我的事情倒是清楚，但你自己的呢？这是你近三年来进的第几个剧组？第一个吧？","id":58,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"邋遢、易怒、毫无职业操守。有哪个剧组还会像我一样把拍摄设备放心地交到你手上？还有哪些活动会雇你担当兼职摄影师？","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"离开？当然可以，作为老朋友我甚至可以不要你支付违约金。但你又能去哪里，阿布纳？","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#8$1","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"你管得着吗？大不了——","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"跳槽？转行？再也不荼毒任何一块镜头，任何一台摄影设备？你可以说些言过其实的狠话，发恶毒的誓。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"但你要是真的嫉恶如仇，为什么还会答应我的邀约，出现在这里？","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#4$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"……","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"还走吗？能走吗？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":71},{"type":"text","text":"阿布纳没有拿起设备，也没有离开。他被生活和往事扣押在原地，沉默伫立。","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你终于冷静下来了。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"往好的地方想想吧。如果这部电影拍成了，说不定你能再拿几个最佳摄影奖。等你片约蜂拥而至的时候，大可拒绝再次加入我的剧组。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1843_1#9$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"别说那些梦话，格蕾塔。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿布纳","text":"我从五年前开始就不相信了。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7c/Avg_avg_npc_1843_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"……","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"好了各位，我知道因为最近的两起意外，有人想起了我们共同经历过的往事，有人听说了一些似是而非的传闻。","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"为了我们之后的拍摄能团结一心，我正式向诸位作出回应。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"现在剧组中大多数人，都是我五年前的合作对象。当时拍摄现场因设备老化，发生了一件令人痛心的意外——","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#4$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"一位年轻的新人演员劳拉不幸命丧当场。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你们可以查阅警方的调查结果，一切公开透明，绝无隐情。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"拍摄天灾这一决定与当年的意外唯一能称为联系的地方是，我在五年前得到了非常宝贵的一项经验——","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我们缺少的从来不是技术，而是胆量。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"当然，这不意味着我将各位的安危置之度外。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我们的移动地块离开蓝卡坞主城区前，我拜访了特里蒙大学的天灾预测专家。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"我从他手中获得了一份十分精准的分析报告，并将数据输入地块导航系统中测试过多次。拍摄地块会与天灾保持安全距离。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"紧急逃生舱内的陆行艇不会设置使用权限，任何一位剧组工作人员只要觉得生命受到威胁就可以自行取用。","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"而我会成为最后一个离开移动地块的人。","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"没有问题的话，散会。","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":96},{"type":"charslot","id":97},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":98},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.8","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"1","id":99},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"你，等等。","id":104},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":107},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","duration":"1","id":108},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":109},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"格、格蕾塔女士……","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"我是不会因为把消息抖出来而道歉的！","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"不用紧张，我只想知道你是从谁那里拿到的文件。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"都说了，是我自己——","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"跳过撒谎的环节。你没那个能力，我没那么多时间。","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"……对于情报提供者我有义务保护他们的隐私……","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/02/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"扰乱片场拍摄违反了合同中的第二和第五款条例，你想从金融终端里看到处罚结果吗？","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"但出于一些特殊原因也可以对外透露——","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1844_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"摄影助理","text":"（小声）是卢西恩先生。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1844_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"text","text":"穿过嘈杂的人群和杂乱的器材，格蕾塔一眼看到了游离于闹剧之外的那个人。","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1828_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卢西恩","text":"……","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1828_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"菲林男人坦然接受格蕾塔冷峻的目光，微微颔首，向她致意。","id":132},{"type":"charslot","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1834_1#6$1","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"格蕾塔","text":"……","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_npc_1834_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":136},{"type":"dialog","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"charslot","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":141},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ec/Avg_bg_62_g9_outsidestudio_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":142},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":143},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":144,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，你是说，昨天晚上迈克尔要见的人是你？","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d8/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"……嗯。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"可谢莉小姐走后我们不是继续看电影了吗？接下来放的是炎国僵尸片……哦——你确实出去了一段时间。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"迈克尔先生给我的终端发了简讯，他说在摄影棚里等我，找我咨询一些非常重要的问题。","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"对不起蒂比，那天是我们约好的电影之夜，我不应该中途离开的，别生气了……","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我确实在生气……","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"蒂比……","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我是在生气……气你怎么不叫我一起。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#3$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯？","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"万一迈克尔对你不怀好意，他的花心已经突破了道德底线，或者因为上午拍摄中断无处发泄，看你性格软就故意欺负你……","id":163,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"嘿，我可从来不欺负女孩子的。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"这话从你嘴里说出来可没有半点说服力。有时你对玛丽昂的态度都很糟糕，更别提对其他女孩子。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#2$1","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"呵，连涉世未深的小姑娘都能看穿你。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"……","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","id":172},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我本来想叫你陪我的，但迈克尔先生强调了只能一个人过去……","id":173,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我也待过几个剧组了，我很熟悉这种“套路”，以为又是某种欺负人的把戏，不想让你跟我一起承受。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽……","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我在蓝卡坞工作的时间比你久一点，熟悉的工种也更多，再遇到类似的人，你一定要告诉我，我可以帮你想个绝妙的点子报复回去。","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"知道了。","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"……侦探小姐，这些话可以之后再聊吗？既然小莫伊拉已经帮我作证了，那现在我的嫌疑可以洗清了吧？","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"迈克尔先生和谢莉小姐或许真的是偶遇。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我们昨天晚上也看到了谢莉小姐离开前的状态……","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"心不在焉，魂不守舍，对吧？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯。可能她真的已经到极限了……","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"话是这么说……","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"小莫伊拉，你能替我作证，我真高兴。","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"感谢你的勇敢，毕竟小蒂比对你的保护欲可能比你真正的姐姐还要强……","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"对了，你的姐姐还在蓝卡坞当演员吗？要是她跟你一样可爱……能不能告诉我她的联系方式？说不定我还能为她介绍剧组。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"被人当成杀人凶手都没办法让你收敛你的滥情吗？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"宝贝，我就随口一问，随口一问……","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"行了，别转移话题了。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"你还是没告诉我，你找莫伊拉的目的是什么？","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我也想知道。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"迈克尔先生，我觉得应该告诉蒂比和玛丽昂小姐。","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"莫伊拉，别——","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"迈克尔先生问我，有什么方法，可以偷偷离开地块。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":213},{"type":"image","id":214},{"type":"charslot","id":215}],"characters":["摄影助理","倒霉的场工","格蕾塔","阿布纳","卢西恩","蒂比","莫伊拉","迈克尔","玛丽昂"]}